{
  "slug": "wiq",
  "name": "Wiq",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bardeen wiq plugin — workflow automation with multi-agent orchestration and OAuth-secured remote MCP.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `wiq` (Automate a WIQ process end-to-end), `wiq-blueprint-from-skill` (Read the content of another named skill and create a WIQ blueprint from it), `wiq-check-tools` (Validate that all required MCP tools are available for a WIQ blueprint), `wiq-try` (Trial run of a WIQ blueprint — executes one ticket at a time with user confirmation after every…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `WIQ`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wiq@claude-community` from `getwiq/wiq-claude-plugin` (`wiq`).",
